/T ( To strengthen evidence-based agricultural research and planning in Kerala, there is a growing need for regular and granular data on crop patterns and farm practices across diverse landscapes. The lean agricultural landscape survey is a structured data collection tool designed to capture farm-level information on climate-smart agricultural practices, with a particular focus on key crops in Kerala, such as rice, banana and coconut. With the objective of enhancing experiential learning and providing )
