/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 54 0 R
/T (practical exposure to data-driven agricultural development, the survey was integrated into the  RAWE \(Rural Agricultural Work Experience\) programme of Kerala Agricultural University \(KAU\). The training programme was conducted across all four agricultural colleges of KAU, reaching a total of 454 students. Each trained student is expected to complete 15 household surveys, collectively contributing to an estimated dataset of approximately 6,810 farm-level observations across the state. The survey is currently in progress, with around 4,000 observations completed to date.)
