/T (  Geospatial mapping and monitoring activities are progressing steadily to support precise assessment of padasekharams boundaries, generate the Digital Terrain Model \(DTM\), Digital Surface Model \(DSM\) datasets and paddy crop condition analysis. Drone mapping of experimental and control plots in Palakkad and Thrissur has been successfully completed, providing high-resolution spatial data\(10cm\). Climatic data extraction from IMD for Kerala has been completed.  Second phase of drone mapping in Palakkad has been carried out, with data pre-processing of drone images in progress. )
