/T (  A one-day training programme was conducted featuring Dr. Narendra Das from Michigan State University, USA, Team Leader of the NASA NISAR Mission, with support from IRRI scientists. The training introduced the basics of radar remote sensing and its applications in detecting key indicators such as soil moisture, crop phenology, and planting dates, effectively engaging the participants and sparking their interest in the subject. Introductory sessions on Synthetic Aperture Radar \(SAR\) and the applications of NISAR L-band datasets were also covered, along with hands-on training.)
