/T ( Ms. Jintu has completed a Diploma in Agricultural Science from the Institute of Agricultural Technology \(IAT\), Regional Agricultural Research Station \(RARS\), Pattambi. Coming from an agricultural family where farming and cultivation form an integral part of daily life, she developed a strong interest in agriculture from a young age. This upbringing, combined with her academic training, has equipped her with both practical experience and theoretical knowledge across various aspects of agriculture and farming practices. She is also one of the skilled field assistants working at the grassroots level, playing a crucial role in supporting data collection and the effective implementation of field activities. )
