/Title (Post-harvest drone surveys and mapping are planned for the Kole fields to capture end-stage field conditions. Ground truthing survey in Palakkkad district for Land Use Land Cover \(LULC\) classification, paddy area validation and crop type delineation has been completed. It is currently progressing in Thrissur where these ground truth points will be used as training sites for calibration of satellite images and accuracy assessment of the geospatial outputs.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
