/Title (Dr. Chaturvedi is a Senior Scientist and Head of the Training and Outreach Research Group at the  Centre for Water Resources Development and Management \(CWRDM\), Kerala, India. He earned his M.Phil. in Environmental Plant Biology and Ph.D. in Plant Physiology and from the High-Altitude Plant Physiology Research Centre, HNB Garhwal Central University, Uttarakhand, India. With over 13 years of research experience, Dr. Chaturvedi has successfully implemented projects funded by prominent agencies, including the Indian Council of Social Science Research \(ICSSR\), Department of Science and Technology \(DST\), Ministry of Jal Shakti \(MoWR\),)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 749 0 R
