860 0 obj
<<
/Title (Ms. Devika serves as Lead, Component-1 \(Climate Resilient Agriculture\) and Agricultural Officer \(Procurement\) at the State Project Management Unit \(SPMU\), KERA Project, Government of Kerala, Thiruvananthapuram. In this role, she anchors key initiatives under Component 1, including the implementation of low-emission paddy cultivation in collaboration with leading research institutions and field teams. She holds dual postgraduate degrees in Plant Breeding and Genetics from Cornell University and Tamil Nadu Agricultural University. Her professional journey since 2013 spans roles at Rasi Seeds, VFPCK, and the State Department of Agriculture, with experience across research, extension, and farmer engagement.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 752 0 R
>>
