/Title (Station-based trials were continued at the Agricultural Research Station \(ARS\), Mannuthy, and the Regional Agricultural Research Station \(RARS\), Pattambi with systematic crop management and regular observations. Key operations included irrigation monitoring, fertilizer application and the implementation of plant protection measures. Regular observations on weed flora were conducted, along with soil and plant sampling.    Biometric data were recorded at)
