/Title (Ms. Rinshina T is a Project Associate under the KERA AWD project at the Agricultural research Station \(ARS\), Mannuthy. In her current role, she coordinates extension activities of the project, manages survey data, and undertakes data analysis and related tasks. She completed her B.Sc. in Agriculture from Acharya N.G. Ranga Agricultural University and holds an M.Sc. in Agricultural Economics from Kerala Agricultural University with specialization in irrigation economics. Her academic contributions include publishing research papers in journals and participating in various national conferences and workshops.)
